# r1113 pwg12r: reruns on the SAME running -12 server (level pwg12), right after pwg12.qb; no new boot, no prep.
# Rows: SQ-PWG-54 (rerun at a new spot, `zpwg6 contraptions all` kept), SQ-PWG-63 (fp absMoveTo fix), and SQ-PWG-60,
# -64, -65, -66 with the row text rewritten after pwg10b (perf/runs/r1113/verdicts/pwg10b.md). Copied from pwg12.qb
# (-54) and pwg10b.qb (the rest), X moved +200 (1100 -> 1300); Z unchanged.
# Area (free in pwg12; its header lists P9a X 1090-1130 Z 1695-1800, P8 nbt X 1095-1165 Z 1670-1685, ponder
# X 1290-1970 Z 1290-1320 (removed), P4 X 1090-1130 Z 1170-1220, P6 X 1085-1125 Z 1385-1520):
#   X 1290 to 1320, Z 1495 to 1680 (SQ-PWG-SETUP12R forceload): -54 Z 1500-1513, -60 Z 1568-1576, -63 Z 1598-1609,
#   -64 Z 1615-1625, -65 Z 1628-1649, -66 Z 1657-1666.
# The first row copies the current pwg_p6/p7/p8 probes over the zz_ copies and reloads (probe fixes: getEncodeId
# entity ids, absMoveTo fake player). -66 copies the CC program into pwg12/computercraft/computer/7/ (shell step).
# -54 deviation: the pwgsolar datapack is already loaded from pwg12's -54, so panel A reads the override too (the
#   `override=none` expect is dropped); the shell + reload steps are kept (idempotent).
# -60 deviation: the villager kill uses a box selector over this area (MCA villagers are not minecraft:villager).
# Run: qrun.py run OUT tools/scratch_query/batches/r1113/pwg12r.qb perf/runs/r1113/pwg12r
# waitlog matches anywhere since the row start; real waits are sleeps (20 ticks = 1 s) plus pace.
pace 1

## SQ-PWG-SETUP12R | copy the current P6/P7/P8 probes, reload; forceload X 1290-1320 Z 1495-1680, clear its animals (not a row)
shell for p in pwg_p6_probe pwg_p7_probe pwg_p8_probe; do cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/$p.js kubejs/server_scripts/zz_$p.js; done; ls -la kubejs/server_scripts/ | grep -E 'zz_pwg_p[678]'
> reload
sleep 40
> forceload add 1290 1495 1320 1680
sleep 5
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doFireTick false
> weather clear
> kill @e[type=!minecraft:player,x=1290,y=-64,z=1495,dx=31,dy=20,dz=186]
sleep 2
> zpwg8 check
waitlog \[zpwg8\] done 30
reject \[zpwg\w*\] error
reject ^(?!.*RuntimeDistCleaner).*(Exception|/ERROR\]).*(powergrid|patryk)
expect \[zpwg8\] done

